Description:You control Kalitas, Traitor of Ghet, have Cast Down in hand and {B}{B} in your mana pool. The opponent controls Luminous Broodmoth and Harrier Naga. End the turn with Harrier Naga in exile and a Zombie token on your battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-281451ea9012b26e | Kalitas replaces the opponent's creature dying with exile (CR 614.6), so it never dies (CR 700.4) and Luminous Broodmoth's dies trigger never happens: destroy Harrier Naga itself, not the Broodmoth
